  notes: "Sealed metal chamber 64x64 px. The upper layer is hydrogen, the lower is oxygen (gas stratification by molar mass). A 2x2 electric_arc seed in the middle delivers the spark. Because cf-atmos sample_cell currently returns Earth-ambient (T=293 K) we boost the cell temp to 295 K and rely on the M19 spark ignition path to push the local temperature past the 700 K H2+O2 autoignition gate. Once fired, the pressure spikes per PV=nRT and steam (M=18.015) replaces the consumed H2 + O2.",
